            "Apologies are not necessary.",
            "What feelings do you have when you apologise?"
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "remember",
      "rank": 5,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "* i remember *",
          "reassemb": [
            "Do you often think of (2)?",
