            "Perhaps you would like to be (2)."
          ] },
        { "decomp": "* you *",
          "reassemb": [
            "We were discussing you, not me.",
            "Oh, I (2)?",
            "You're not really talking about me, are you?"
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "computer",
      "rank": 50,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": [
            "Do computers worry you?",
            "Why do you mention computers?",
            "What do you think machines have to do with your problem?"
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "because",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": [
            "Is that the real reason?",
            "Don't any other reasons come to mind?",
            "Does that reason seem to explain anything else?"
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "yes",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": ["You seem quite positive.", "You are sure.", "I understand."] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "no",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": ["Are you saying no just to be negative?", "Why not?", "Why 'no'?"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "name",
      "rank": 15,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": [
            "I am not interested in names.",
            "I've told you before, I don't care about names, please continue."
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "hello",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": ["How do you do. Please state your problem.", "Hi. What seems to be your problem?"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "dream",
      "rank": 3,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": [
            "What does that dream suggest to you?",
            "Do you dream often?",
            "Does the dream have anything to do with your situation?"
          ] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "always",
      "rank": 1,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": ["Can you think of a specific example?", "When?", "Really, always?"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "what",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [
        { "decomp": "*",
          "reassemb": ["Why do you ask?", "Does that question interest you?", "What answer would please you most?"] }
      ]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "how",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [{ "decomp": "*", "delegate": "what" }]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "perhaps",
      "rank": 0,
      "rules": [{ "decomp": "*",
        "reassemb": ["You don't seem quite certain.", "Why the uncertain tone?", "Can't you be more positive?"] }]
    },
    {
      "keyword": "everyone",
      "rank": 2,
      "rules": [{ "decomp": "* @everyone *",
        "reassemb": ["Really, (2)?", "Surely not (2).", "Can you think of anyone in particular?"] }]
    }
  ]
}
